    {
      "name": "Post List Row",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "post-list-row",
      "description": "사이트의 기본 단위. 날짜와 제목 두 조각만 가진 장부 한 줄.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-post-row\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-post-row__date\">2026.11.03</span><span class=\"ds-post-row__title\">BNF의 제이컴 거래와 25일선 이격도</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-post-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f3f3;text-decoration:none;font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif}.ds-post-row__date{font-size:12.5px;color:#aaaaaa;white-space:nowrap;min-width:80px;flex:0 0 auto}.ds-post-row__title{font-size:14.4px;color:#000;line-height:1.4;transition:opacity .2s}.ds-post-row:hover .ds-post-row__title{opacity:.7}.ds-post-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0057a7;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Widget",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "sidebar-widget",
      "description": "아이콘 제목 + 2px 하단 괘선 + 들여쓴 내용. 사이드바의 유일한 구조.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-widget\"><div class=\"ds-widget__title\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"/></svg>카테고리</div><div class=\"ds-widget__body\"><a class=\"ds-widget__link\" href=\"#\">AI</a><a class=\"ds-widget__link\" href=\"#\">Engineering</a><a class=\"ds-widget__link\" href=\"#\">Insights</a></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-widget{border-bottom:2px solid #f1f1f1;font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif}.ds-widget__title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#000;padding:12px 0 12px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #f1f1f1}.ds-widget__body{padding:8px 0 30px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.ds-widget__link{font-size:14px;color:#555;text-decoration:none;transition:color .5s}.ds-widget__link:hover{color:#0057a7}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tag Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag-chip",
      "description": "태그 전용 칩. 카테고리에는 쓰지 않는다.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-chip\" href=\"#\">agents</a>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-block;padding:3px 5px;border-radius:4px;background:#6c757d;color:#fff;font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:background .5s}.ds-chip:hover,.ds-chip:focus-visible{background:#0057a7;color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Nav Link",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-link",
      "description": "상단 고정 바의 링크. 회색에서 흰색으로만 변한다.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav__brand\" href=\"#\">신규하 블로그</a><span class=\"ds-nav__links\"><a class=\"ds-nav__link\" href=\"#\">블로그</a><a class=\"ds-nav__link ds-nav__link--active\" href=\"#\">카테고리</a><a class=\"ds-nav__link\" href=\"#\">태그</a></span></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:55px;border-bottom:2px solid #fff;background:#010205cb;padding:0 20px;font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif}.ds-nav__brand{color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav__links{display:flex;gap:4px}.ds-nav__link{padding:.5em 1em;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#aaaaaa;text-decoration:none;transition:color .5s}.ds-nav__link:hover,.ds-nav__link:focus-visible,.ds-nav__link--active{color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hero Band",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "hero-title",
      "description": "어두운 관측 띠. 사이트에서 유일하게 큰 요소이며 유일한 어두운 면.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hero\"><h1 class=\"ds-hero__title\">신규하 블로그</h1><p class=\"ds-hero__sub\">개발 기록 보관소</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-hero{min-height:150px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;background:#010205 radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, #1b1a3a 0%, #010205 70%);font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;text-align:center;padding:24px}.ds-hero__title{margin:0;font-size:25.2px;font-weight:500;color:#fff;line-height:1.5}.ds-hero__sub{margin:0;font-size:16.9px;color:#999}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search Control",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search-field",
      "description": "사이트에서 유일하게 부드러운(18px 알약) 요소. 입력과 버튼이 한 쌍.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-search\"><input class=\"ds-search__field\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"검색어\"><button class=\"ds-search__submit\">검색</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;gap:0.9rem;font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;max-width:760px}.ds-search__field{flex:1;height:56px;padding:0 1.35rem;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(35,35,35,.08);font-size:16px;color:#555;background:#fff;transition:border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease,transform .2s ease}.ds-search__field::placeholder{color:#999}.ds-search__field:focus{outline:none;border-color:rgba(0,87,167,.35);box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(0,87,167,.12);transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-search__submit{min-width:120px;height:56px;padding:0 1.6rem;border:0;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0059ac 0%,#4490c3 100%);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(0,89,172,.2);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}.ds-search__submit:hover,.ds-search__submit:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 18px 36px rgba(0,89,172,.24)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Code Block",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "code-block",
      "description": "본문 코드. 호버 시에만 복사 버튼이 나타난다.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-code\"><button class=\"ds-code__copy\" aria-label=\"복사\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10\"/></svg></button><pre><code>hugo server -D --bind=0.0.0.0</code></pre></div>",
      "css": ".ds-code{position:relative}.ds-code pre{margin:0;padding:20px;background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14.4px;color:#333}.ds-code code{font-family:inherit}.ds-code__copy{position:absolute;top:8px;right:8px;width:32px;height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s,background .3s}.ds-code:hover .ds-code__copy,.ds-code__copy:focus-visible{opacity:1}.ds-code__copy:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.12)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Callout Note",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": null,
      "description": "GitHub 경보 스타일 콜아웃. 배경을 칠하지 않고 좌측 띠만 쓴다.",
      "html": "<blockquote class=\"ds-callout\"><p class=\"ds-callout__head\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0969da\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01M11 12h1v5h1\"/></svg>참고</p><p class=\"ds-callout__body\">본문 알림 상자는 배경을 칠하지 않고 좌측 5px 띠로만 구분한다.</p></blockquote>",
